# Operational endpoints. None of these needs an API key.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5104

### Liveness: the process is up (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Readiness: the supplier registry is not empty and the identity, booking and crosswalk stores answer (200, or 503 when one does not)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### The OpenAPI document (200). The committed copy is docs/openapi.json.
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json

### A correlation id is echoed back (or generated when absent) in the X-Correlation-Id response header
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live
X-Correlation-Id: demo-correlation-1
